while running

 docker run --env MYSQL_HOST_PARAM=host.docker.internal --env MY_POD_NAME=docker-container --env SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=local data-jpa-poc-bash


JVM shutdown and Spring shutdown hook , @PreDestroy are not  invoked as the main process that starts the container is the bash script and the spring application is not the main process.
SIGTERM signal is sent to the main process of container as per documantation and thus is lost and not traversed to spring boot process